        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "僕は夜中に森の奥で大きな音がして困っていると相談され、\n調査にきていた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "de82fa70d1e520eb03f02c33676edbedf3ad2b0ce3f6564c411d55c4225568f0",
