    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "76576c0849292795d3427be8ac5528e207f7938eaaf146b37ec8b8c0f149a491",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 4,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "何かが打ち付けられる音が聞こえて怯えてしまったが、\nその正体は五寸釘をわら人形に打ち付けるランカさんだった。",
      "jp_sha256": "0d092254b168f810454b4c9c5f056848e511f8814ccf980a7368d3a936c668d6",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "무언가 내리치는 소리가 들려 겁을 먹었지만,\n그 정체는 오촌못을 짚 인형에 박는 란카 씨였다.",
      "message_index_0based": 4,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 18,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b007-20261106-398afd64-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "e4d67969d83f4edfe49c8cf044b204e60f8ae5fcf8f972ee54634fe681d318cf:000002_8122968805695815983:g0:r17",
      "row_index_0based": 17,
      "serialized_row_index": 17,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "何かが打ち付けられる音が聞こえて怯えてしまったが、\nその正体は五寸釘をわら人形に打ち付けるランカさんだった。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
